## Model card

- **Name:** Codestral
- **Short description:** Bare-name tracked slug for Mistral's Codestral line — resolves to the hosted `codestral-latest` route (256K ctx), which models.dev maps to the only published lineage (`mistralai/Codestral-22B-v0.1`, May 2024, open weights) plus the later `codestral-25.08` SKU (tracked separately in this dataset). Flag for orchestrator: this bare slug likely aliases the 22B route, not a distinct model.
- **Provider / access:** Mistral La Plateforme (hosted; `codestral-latest`); open weights (`mistralai/Codestral-22B-v0.1` on HF); 5 providers per models.dev.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2024-05-29 (Codestral 22B v0.1 lineage); updated rows 2025-01-04.
- **IDs:** `codestral` / `codestral-latest`; HF `mistralai/Codestral-22B-v0.1`
- **Context window:** 256,000 tokens (codestral-latest; models.dev) / 32,768 (22B-v0.1).
- **Modalities:** text in → text out; reasoning NO; tool calls yes.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $0.30 / 1M input, $0.90 / 1M output (models.dev).
- **Architecture:** proprietary/open MoE-class; Codestral 22B v0.1 = dense 22B (HF).

